●​ Fostering an open environment where discussing mental health and workload 
concerns is normalised, and free of stigma. 
With regard to general and mental health concerns, Volt commits to: 
●​ Understanding and respecting workload fluctuations or personal circumstances; 
●​ Encouraging a healthy culture that prioritises well-being alongside productivity; 
●​ Providing access to psychological support through the relevant body of 
representation, or via the EOO when additional assistance is needed. 


